{"script":"s_2_6_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]哦，几位不是解决了异变的英雄吗！我的确是瓦菲诺的学者。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]你们连续开拓了安瑟恩还有阿娜希塔，不但为荒野和山地解决了异变，还给了我们深入遗迹探查的机会！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]不论是探索者还是研究者，这都是千载难逢的机遇呀！谢谢你们！呼啊～好困。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"说起来……","tag":"tag_8"},{"text":"那个少年你认识吗？","tag":"tag_8"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[cm][show]少年？你们说帕扎迪恩吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]原来你们也认识他啊，莫非他也是你们的熟人吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]不，也谈不上熟人。这个该怎么和你们说呢……我们也觉得很奇怪。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]我们当时在探索的时候被一群魔物袭击，正棘手时，路过的他帮我们击退了那群魔物。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]然后他就一直在山神之殒附近晃悠，时不时就出手帮我们一下，还分给我们一些药水和附近的素材呢。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]他为什么要帮你们啊？难道想从你们口中得到遗迹的线索？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]没关系，我们对遗迹可是守口如瓶。之前我们也问过他为什么帮我们，他说想帮就帮了，没有别的想法。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唔……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]我们起先也不太信任他，但他确实一直在帮我们的忙。而且我们表达不方便后，他也再没有问过我们在做什么。也许，他真的是个大好人呢。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"纯粹的好人吗……","tag":"tag_19"},{"text":"也不是没有这种人。","tag":"tag_19"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]嗯！说起这种人，{myName}也算一个吧～！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[show]放心吧，我们也一直在观察他。至少可以确认，这家伙应该不知道遗迹的事。呼啊～[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"辛苦了。","tag":"tag_22"},{"text":"您好像很困倦的样子……","tag":"tag_22"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"探索队员","text":"[cm][show]那没办法。做这一行就得辛苦点。你们也请继续加油啊，遗迹开拓者！呼啊～[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"你们是瓦菲诺的人吧？"}